~ start
手机: 要看什么？
- 重要的事 [ID:open_documents] [#repeatable] => documents
- 记事本 [ID:open_notes] [#repeatable] => notes
- 玩手机消磨时间 [ID:waste_time] [#repeatable] => waste_time
- 关闭 [#repeatable] => END

~ documents
do phone.OpenDocuments()
=> END

~ notes
do phone.OpenNotebook()
=> END

~ waste_time
do phone.OpenTimeSkip()
=> END
